OL,3,GNEWSA'Unreasonable delay' in spotting
OL,4,Acancer in patient who later died
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unnamed Highland medical practice
OL,7,Fhas been told to apologise to the
OL,8,Fpatient's family for an "unreasonable
OL,9,Fdelay in recognising specific symptoms"
OL,10,Findicating their loved one may have
OL,11,Fcancer.
